ork 10 hours for free. \\n\\n❌ Go back to a client who already said yes and ask for more money.\\n\\nAt least, those used to be your only two.\\n\\n✅ Now there's a third. Paste their URL into Relume CMS.\\n\\nIt imports posts straight from their live site. \\n\\n---\\n\\nHave you ever had to re-quote a project after seeing the content?\"}}},\"rest_id\":\"2115534367208386726\",\"url_entities\":[],\"views\":{\"count\":\"1157\"}}}}},\"entry_id\":\"tweet-2115534367208386726\",\"sort_index\":\"2118686704456957950\"},{\"content\":{\"__typename\":\"TimelineTimelineItem\",\"client_event_info\":{\"component\":\"organic_tweets\",\"element\":\"tweet\"},\"content\":{\"__isTimelineTimelineItemContent\":\"TimelineTweet\",\"__typename\":\"TimelineTweet\",\"display_type\":\"Tweet\",\"tweet_results\":{\"id\":\"VHdlZXRSZXN1bHRzOjIxMTUyNzI0NDUyNTA3MTk5OTA=\",\"rest_id\":\"2115272445250719990\",\"result\":{\"__isTweetResult\":\"Tweet\",\"__typename\":\"Tweet\",\"cashtag_attachments\":[],\"core\":{\"user_results\":{\"id\":\"VXNlclJlc3VsdHM6MTQ2MjY2NTYzMzU1MjczMjE2Mw==\",\"result\":{\"__typename\":\"User\",\"avatar\":{\"image_url\":\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2092043302661206016/t4U3vJmK_normal.jpg\"},\"core\":{\"name\":\"Relume\",\"screen_name\":\"relume_ai\"},\"id\":\"VXNlcjoxNDYyNjY1NjMzNTUyNzMyMTYz\",\"identity_profile_labels_highlighted_label\":{},\"location\":{\"location\":\"\"},\"parody_commentary_fan_label\":\"None\",\"privacy\":{\"protected\":false},\"profile_bio\":{\"description\":\"Build and grow your website with Relume\"},\"profile_image_shape\":\"Circle\",\"profile_translation\":{\"translator_type_enum\":\"None\"},\"relationship_counts\":{\"followers\":20727,\"following\":50},\"rest_id\":\"1462665633552732163\",\"super_follow_eligible\":false,\"tweet_counts\":{\"tweets\":1631},\"verification\":{\"is_blue_verified\":true}}}},\"counts\":{\"bookmark_count\":6,\"favorite_count\":11,\"quote_count\":0,\"reply_count\":2,\"retweet_count\":2},\"details\":{\"cashtag_entiti