max-w-full text-body font-bold text-primary line-clamp-1 break-all min-w-0">Relume</div></a><div class="max-w-full text-body font-normal text-primary flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1"><span aria-label="Verified account" class="flex cursor-pointer items-center" role="button" tabindex="0" data-base-ui-click-trigger="" id="base-ui-_R_3v5956dlaemkipilhbl56_" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false"><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" display="flex" role="img" width="1em" height="1em" aria-hidden="true" aria-label="Verified account" class="size-[1em] shrink-0"><use href="#icon-verified-premium-color"></use></svg></span></div></span><span class="flex max-w-full min-w-0 items-center gap-2"><a class="rounded-xs x-link disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-70 max-w-full min-w-0 active" href="/relume_ai" data-status="active" aria-current="page"><span class="max-w-full text-body font-normal text-secondary line-clamp-1 wrap-break-word [font-feature-settings:&#x27;ss01&#x27;]">@relume_ai</span></a></span></div><span class="inline-flex w-fit shrink-0 whitespace-nowrap"><a class="rounded-xs x-link disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-70 hover:underline max-w-full text-body text-secondary inline-flex w-fit" id="_R_5u956dlaemkipilhbl56_" data-base-ui-tooltip-trigger="" href="/relume_ai/status/2117671901015506972">Nov 3</a><script nonce="6Iz3W+mn+xcsvR/uVKtnXA==">window.__xClientTextFormatters?.run("_R_5u956dlaemkipilhbl56_", "formatRelativePastTimestamp", {"timestamp":1793727300000,"lang":"en","nowLabel":"Now","precision":"Hours"});</script></span></div><div class="-me-[5px] flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1 whitespace-nowrap"><button data-slot="xds-menu-trigger" tabindex="0" aria-haspopup="menu" aria-expanded="false" id="base-ui-_R_3ach56dlaemkipilhbl56_" aria-label="More" type="button" class="group x-button transition-colors h-8 text-subtext1 [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#x27;size-&#x27;])]:size-4 text-primary hover:bg-btn-ghost-hover aria-expanded:bg-btn-ghost-hover active:bg-btn-ghost-pressed w-8 min-w-8 px-0 [&amp;_svg]:transition-transform [&amp;_svg]:duration-200 group-hover:[&amp;_svg]:scale-110 -my-2 shrink-0" style="border-radius:9999px"><span class="x-button-slot" style="opacity:1"><svg fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" display="flex" role="img" width="1em" height="1em" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#icon-more-dots-hor"></use></svg></span></button></div></div><div class="max-w-full text-body font-normal text-primary whitespace-pre-wrap wrap-anywhere" dir="auto"><span class="max-w-full text-[length:inherit] font-[weight:inherit] text-[color:inherit]">Today we’re launching Relume Studio!

Most AI image tools give you one great picture. Then the face changes, the office moves and everything starts to look like generic AI. You can’t run a brand on images that don’t match.

Studio fixes that by locking things in:
